~ start
if not Dialogue.finished_rudolph_intro:
	set Dialogue.finished_rudolph_intro = true
	=> intro
elif not Dialogue.started_acorn_quest:
	% Rudolph: We should go talk to Ol' Man Acorn and see if he has any errands for us!
	% Rudolph: I'm only helping you for now!
	=> END
elif Dialogue.finished_acorn_quest:
	%
		Rudolph: With that, we can finally purchase those supplies!
		Player: ...
		Rudolph: Oh right! The developers didn't add a shop, huh?
		Player: ...
		Rudolph: What's a fourth wall?
		=> END
	%
		Rudolph: That was so much fun!
		Player: !!!
		Rudolph: Travel the world with you? ...Okay!
		=> END
elif Dialogue.can_finish_acorn_quest:
	%
		Rudolph: We should head back and tell Ol' Man Acorn!
		=> END
	%
		Rudolph: Really? Porkchop?
		Porkchop: [i]Oink?[/i]
		Rudolph: No, I didn't mean... nevermind
		=> END
else:
	Rudolph: I can't believe you spent all your money on muffins
	=> END

~ leftbehind
Rudolph: Oh hey! Where are you off to so suddenly?
Player: ...
=> intro2

~ intro
Rudolph: I love it here
Player: ...
Rudolph: That's part of the charm!
Player: ...
Rudolph: Oh... I see. Where would you go instead?
Player: ...
=> intro2

~ intro2
Rudolph: [shake rate=20 level=10]YOU WANT TO TRAVEL THE WHOLE WORLD?[/shake] That's... That's...
Player: ...
Rudolph: But it could take years!
Player: ... !
Rudolph: And it's dangerous!
Player: ... [shake rate=20 level=10]!!![/shake]
Rudolph: Okay Okay! Then you'll need to get some supplies
Player: ...
Rudolph: [shake rate=20 level=10]You spent all your money on muffins?![/shake]
Rudolph: Well... What about Ol' Man Acorn?
Player: ...?
Rudolph: Yeah! They might have some errands for you
Player: [shake rate=20 level=10] !!![/shake]
Rudolph: Good luck!
Player: [shake rate=20 level=10] !!!!!![/shake]
Rudolph: You want me to come with you?
Player: [shake rate=20 level=10] !!![/shake]
Rudolph: Okay! I'll talk to him for you.
Rudolph: Let's do this!
=> END